#: kptbuiltinschedulerplugin.cpp:38
msgctxt "Network = task dependency network"
msgid "Network Scheduler"
msgstr "Programador da axenda en rede"

#: kptbuiltinschedulerplugin.cpp:39
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Built-in network (PERT) based scheduler"
msgstr "Programador baseado na rede interna (TREP)"

#: kptbuiltinschedulerplugin.cpp:48
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<title>Network (PERT) Scheduler</title><para>The network scheduler generally "
"schedules tasks according to their dependencies. When a task is scheduled it "
"is scheduled in full, booking the allocated resources if available. If "
"overbooking is not allowed, subsequent tasks that requests the same resource "
"will be scheduled later in time.</para><para>Tasks with time constraints "
"will be scheduled first to minimize the problem with resource conflicts</"
"para><para><note>This scheduler does not handle resource conflicts well.<nl/"
">You can try a different scheduler if available. You may also change "
"resource allocations or add dummy dependencies to avoid the conflicts.</"
"note></para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>O planificador de axenda na rede (TREP)</title><para>A programación "
"da axenda na rede xeralmente marcas as tarefas de acordo coas súas "
"dependencias. Cando se marca unha tarefa, márcase ao completo, ocupando "
"tódolos recursos dispoñíbeis se os houber. Se non se permite a saturación de "
"recursos as tarefas seguintes que soliciten o mesmo recursos serán asignadas "
"temporalmente máis tarde.</para><para>As tarefas con contrición temporal "
"marcaranse de primeiras para minimizar o problema cos conflitos de recursos. "
"</para><para><note>O planificador non xestiona ben os conflitos de recursos."
"<nl/>Pode probar un planificador diferente se o ten dispoñíbel. Pode así "
"mesmo cambiar a asignación de recursos ou engadir dependencias irrelevantes "
"para evitar os conflitos.</note></para>"

